Taskathlon is a modified version of GridCraft (https://github.com/storytold/gridcraft),
an open-source spreadsheet by the ArtCraft team. Changes made by Taskathlon:
  - added the trainer: crates/learn (gridcraft-learn-core) and apps/gridcraft-learn
    (binary `taskathlon`), plus docs/images/taskathlon-*.png;
  - removed the ArtCraft brand files (docs/brand/), packaging and CI workflows;
  - replaced ArtCraft links in the GridCraft About dialog and Help menu with plain-text
    attribution and links to the upstream repository.
